# Build context of testrigs/Dockerfile (the repository root): only what the image copies or compiles. The rest of
# the checkout, the run folder and any build output on the host stay out.
*
!runner/pyproject.toml
!runner/README.md
!runner/constraints.txt
!runner/src
!third_party/oidf-conformance-suite
!conformance
!testrigs/pom.xml
!testrigs/apitest-commons-conformance/pom.xml
!testrigs/apitest-commons-conformance/src
!testrigs/inji-certify-api-test/pom.xml
!testrigs/inji-certify-api-test/src
!testrigs/inji-certify-api-test/testNgXmlFiles
!testrigs/inji-verify-api-test/pom.xml
!testrigs/inji-verify-api-test/src
!testrigs/inji-verify-api-test/testNgXmlFiles
testrigs/*/src/logs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
